    "created_at": "2025-06-28T12:15:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-06-28T12:15:49Z",
    "body": "I agree this could use clarification.\n\nAll major browsers (Chrome, Firefox, Safari) return the same `RadioNodeList` object on repeated calls to `form.namedItem(\"name\")`. So it's clear that the intent is not to create a new object each time.\n\nIt would help if the spec explicitly allowed (or recommended) returning the same object to avoid misleading implementers.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
